---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy | Type One Den"
  description="Read the Type One Den privacy policy, including how data is collected, used, and protected."
>
  <main class="bg-[#0F0F0F] py-16 text-[#F5F5F5]" style="font-family: Inter, sans-serif;">
    <div class="max-w-[720px] mx-auto px-4 space-y-8">
      <header class="space-y-4">
        <p class="text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-[#F472B6]">Privacy Policy</p>
        <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl" style="font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;">Your privacy matters here</h1>
        <p class="leading-8 text-[#999999]">This Privacy Policy explains how Type One Den collects, uses, and protects personal information when you visit typeoneden.com, subscribe to the newsletter, or interact with embedded tools and third-party services.</p>
      </header>

      <section class="space-y-4 rounded-3xl border border-[#2E2E2E] bg-[#1A1A1A] p-8">
        <h2 class="text-2xl" style="font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;">Information we collect</h2>
        <p class="leading-8 text-[#999999]">We may collect personal information you voluntarily provide, including your name and email address when you subscribe to the newsletter through Kit or contact the site directly. We may also collect limited technical data such as browser type, device information, referring pages, and general usage analytics through cookies or similar technologies.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-4 rounded-3xl border border-[#2E2E2E] bg-[#1A1A1A] p-8">
        <h2 class="text-2xl" style="font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;">How your information is used</h2>
        <p class="leading-8 text-[#999999]">Information is used to deliver newsletter emails, respond to messages, improve the website experience, understand which content is helpful, and maintain the security and performance of the site. Type One Den does not sell personal information.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-4 rounded-3xl border border-[#2E2E2E] bg-[#1A1A1A] p-8">
        <h2 class="text-2xl" style="font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;">Cookies and tracking technologies</h2>
        <p class="leading-8 text-[#999999]">Type One Den may use cookies, pixels, and similar technologies to remember preferences, measure traffic, and support embedded or affiliate content. You can usually control cookies through your browser settings. Disabling cookies may affect some features or embedded content.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-4 rounded-3xl border border-[#2E2E2E] bg-[#1A1A1A] p-8">
        <h2 class="text-2xl" style="font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;">Third-party services</h2>
        <div class="space-y-3 leading-8 text-[#999999]">
          <p><strong class="text-[#F5F5F5]">Kit newsletter:</strong> Email signups may be processed through Kit or a similar email service provider, which stores subscriber information and manages email delivery.</p>
          <p><strong class="text-[#F5F5F5]">YouTube embeds:</strong> Embedded videos may collect data as described in YouTube and Google privacy policies, including cookies and viewing metrics.</p>
          <p><strong class="text-[#F5F5F5]">Giscus comments:</strong> If comments are enabled, Giscus may process GitHub-related account information and interactions according to its own privacy practices.</p>
          <p><strong class="text-[#F5F5F5]">Affiliate links:</strong> Clicking affiliate links may allow third-party merchants or networks to use cookies to track referrals for commission purposes.</p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-4 rounded-3xl border border-[#2E2E2E] bg-[#1A1A1A] p-8">
        <h2 class="text-2xl" style="font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;">Your rights</h2>
        <p class="leading-8 text-[#999999]">Depending on where you live, including under GDPR or CCPA-style privacy laws, you may have rights to request access to, correction of, deletion of, or restriction of your personal data, and to opt out of certain processing. To make a privacy-related request, contact the email listed below.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-4 rounded-3xl border border-[#2E2E2E] bg-[#1A1A1A] p-8">
        <h2 class="text-2xl" style="font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;">Data retention and security</h2>
        <p class="leading-8 text-[#999999]">Personal information is retained only as long as reasonably necessary for the purposes described in this policy, unless a longer retention period is required by law. Reasonable administrative, technical, and organizational safeguards are used to protect information, but no internet transmission or storage system can be guaranteed completely secure.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-4 rounded-3xl border border-[#2E2E2E] bg-[#1A1A1A] p-8">
        <h2 class="text-2xl" style="font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;">Contact</h2>
        <p class="leading-8 text-[#999999]">Questions about this Privacy Policy or your personal information can be sent to <a href="mailto:hello@typeoneden.com" class="text-[#F472B6] underline decoration-transparent underline-offset-4 transition hover:decoration-current">hello@typeoneden.com</a>.</p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
